  "cards": [
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 59,
      "title": {
        "es": "Atención médica con marcados contrastes",
        "en": "Attentive veterinarians alongside reception complaints"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Gran cantidad de tutores agradece la calidez de doctoras como Norma, Denise y Nayeli en Lindavista, destacando su compromiso y explicaciones claras en urgencias. Sin embargo, diversos clientes expresan fuerte molestia por la lentitud y respuestas ásperas del personal de recepción, además de demoras notables en cobros y trámites.",
        "en": "Many pet owners praise veterinarians like Dr. Norma, Dr. Denise, and Dr. Nayeli in Lindavista for their dedication and clear guidance during emergencies. Conversely, several clients voice frustration over rude and slow front desk staff, citing unhelpful administrative handling and lengthy waits for billing assistance."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "es": "Recuperaciones críticas y diagnósticos cuestionados",
        "en": "Critical recoveries alongside diagnostic disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Múltiples reseñas celebran la recuperación de cachorros frente a enfermedades complejas como parvovirus y panleucopenia, valorando el monitoreo intensivo. En contraste, usuarios críticos reportan diagnósticos erróneos y tratamientos fallidos que no lograron estabilizar a sus mascotas, generando inconformidad con los protocolos seguidos.",
        "en": "Multiple reviews celebrate pets recovering from life-threatening conditions such as parvovirus and panleukopenia, crediting intensive hospital monitoring. In contrast, several dissatisfied owners report misdiagnoses and ineffective treatment protocols that failed to resolve acute illnesses, leading to severe disappointment."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "es": "Retrasos en citas y urgencias",
        "en": "Delays in scheduled and emergency care"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Aunque varios tutores señalan atención nocturna inmediata en urgencias de madrugada, otros clientes reportan demoras de hasta dos horas para ser atendidos a pesar de tener cita confirmada. Se aconseja acudir con anticipación y confirmar horarios para evitar tiempos muertos en la sala de espera.",
        "en": "While several clients report prompt triage during late-night emergency visits, other pet parents describe waiting up to two hours to be seen despite holding confirmed appointments. Visiting with ample time and confirming current clinic capacity beforehand is strongly advised by regular visitors."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "es": "¿El hospital veterinario abre las 24 horas?",
        "en": "Is the veterinary hospital open 24 hours?"
      },
      "a": {
        "es": "Sí, ofrecen servicio continuo de urgencias las 24 horas del día durante todo el año.",
        "en": "Yes, they provide continuous 24/7 veterinary emergency care every day of the year."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "es": "¿Qué documentos solicitan al registrarse?",
        "en": "What documents are required upon patient check-in?"
      },
      "a": {
        "es": "Suelen solicitar identificación oficial vigente (INE) para el registro administrativo de la mascota.",
        "en": "They typically request an official voter ID (INE) for administrative patient registration."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "es": "¿Cuentan con laboratorio e imagenología para diagnósticos?",
        "en": "Do they offer laboratory tests and diagnostic imaging?"
      },
      "a": {
        "es": "Sí, disponen de estudios de ultrasonido, rayos X y análisis clínicos para diagnósticos internos.",
        "en": "Yes, they provide ultrasound scans, digital X-rays, and in-house laboratory testing for diagnoses."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
